@startuml
title Home Stack — Architecture
actor User
actor "IoT Device" as Device

node "MQTT Proxy" as MQTT
node "REST Proxy / API Gateway" as REST

cloud "Kubernetes (RaspberryPi)" as K8s

User --> REST : HTTP/REST
Device --> MQTT : MQTT

REST --> "home-api-service" : API calls
"home-api-service" --> "home-auth-service" : auth checks
"home-api-service" --> "home-category-api" : category data
"home-api-service" --> "home-search-service" : search queries
"home-api-service" --> "home-dashboard" : notifications/UI

MQTT --> "iot-telemetry-service" : telemetry ingest
"iot-telemetry-service" --> "home-etl-service" : processed data
"home-etl-service" --> "home-commons" : shared logic

"home-scheduler-task" --> "home-etl-service" : scheduled runs
"email-service" --> "home-api-service" : outbound email

"rest-proxy" --> "home-api-service" : proxy requests
"mqtt-proxy" --> "iot-telemetry-service" : MQTT bridge

"liquibase" --> "home-api-service" : DB migrations
"graalvm-builder" --> "home-api-service" : build images

K8s --> "home-api-service"
K8s --> "iot-telemetry-service"
K8s --> "home-dashboard"

note left of "home-api-service": Uses home-commons, auth, category, search
note right of K8s: Deployment manifests in RaspberryPi-Kubernetes
@enduml
